Package: gnome-shell-extension-xdock
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 gnome-shell (>= 50~),
 gnome-shell (<< 51~)
Recommends: gnome-rounded-blur
Description: GNOME Shell extension: the NorviOS dock and app launcher
 A dock for GNOME Shell, based on Dash to Dock: pinned and running apps at
 the edge of the screen, window previews, intelligent autohide and
 notification badges. The Applications button can open a compact launcher
 with search, the most-used apps, drawers kept as GNOME app folders, and
 buttons for Settings, locking and the power menu. With gnome-rounded-blur
 installed, what is behind a translucent dock is blurred, rounded to the
 dock's corners.
 .
 After installing, log out and back in once, then enable it with
 `gnome-extensions enable xdock@spencercnorton.github.io`.
